        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Discovery Zone, Valentino's, Leaps and Bounds\n- Places: Kansas City, Missouri, Lincoln, Nebraska\n- Products/Services: entertainment facilities, indoor mazes, Italian restaurants\n\nFacts:\n- Discovery Zone was a chain of entertainment facilities for young children that featured games, elaborate indoor mazes, roller slides, climbing play structures, and ball pits.\n- The first Discovery Zone location opened in Kansas City, Missouri, in October 1989.\n- Leaps and Bounds was merged with competitor Discovery Zone in 1995.\n- Valentino's is a regional Italian restaurant chain based in Lincoln, Nebraska.",
